 or\, it features an element of audience inspired improvisation. Get your ti
 ckets for a night of CERTIFIED FOOL-ishness.\n\nPlease note\, there is a 2 
 item per person minimum in the showroom. This can be any combination of foo
 d items or beverages. This does NOT include items bought in the basement at
