 t serve\, therefore we cannot guarantee seating together. Groups need to be
  particularly aware of this. We recommend arriving at least 30 minutes to a
 n hour prior to show time for better seat selection.\n\nDoors close 30 minu
 tes after showtime.\n\nTickets are available at the door UNLESS tickets hav
 e sold out.\n\nGuests must be 18+for entry. Those under the age of 21 will 
